# Repository-wide cross-platform source identity.
# All detected text is checked out with canonical LF; binary formats are excluded.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary

